cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "NIST CSF 2.0 AI-Assisted Evidence & Gap Analysis Tool"
abstract: >-
  Free, open-source command-line tool for NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF) 2.0
  Organizational Profiles. It maps an organization's own documents to all 106 CSF 2.0
  Subcategory outcomes with an AI model, verifies every supporting quote verbatim in code,
  requires human review, and produces a Current Profile, a Target Profile, a prioritized
  remediation plan, and a self-contained dashboard. The repository includes the evaluation
  harness and the raw model outputs behind its published measurements (eval/RESULTS.md).
authors:
